WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:19.144 --> 00:00:20.145
Hold your breath.

00:00:40.165 --> 00:00:41.166
The silence.

00:00:43.168 --> 00:00:44.169
It's peaceful.

00:00:47.923 --> 00:00:49.174
But you think that's weird.

00:00:51.301 --> 00:00:52.177
No.

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:55.055
Not at all.

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:39.141
I thought that you
just wanted to be friends.

00:01:44.438 --> 00:01:46.690
I don't think we can
ever be just friends.

00:02:04.124 --> 00:02:05.918
The only feeling

00:02:06.001 --> 00:02:08.504
you are in fact capable
of engendering, my lord,

00:02:08.587 --> 00:02:10.005
-is that of discontent.
-Do not move.

00:02:10.088 --> 00:02:11.798
-Do you not tell me what--
-Stand still, damn it!

00:02:19.473 --> 00:02:21.683
-No, do not! Leave it!
-It is only a bee. Ow!

00:02:25.854 --> 00:02:27.272
-Are you hurt?
-What?

00:02:27.356 --> 00:02:28.607
Can you breathe?

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:30.275
It is only a sting,
of course.

00:02:30.359 --> 00:02:31.443
Are you certain?

00:02:32.986 --> 00:02:34.321
-My lord?
-No, no.

00:02:34.404 --> 00:02:35.322
Do not…

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:37.324
-My lord?
-Do not…

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:41.203
I am unharmed.

00:02:42.788 --> 00:02:43.789
I am unharmed.

00:02:55.509 --> 00:02:58.303
It was just… a bee.

00:03:23.453 --> 00:03:25.038
Go ahead.
I'll be right there.

00:03:34.423 --> 00:03:36.758
Hi. Was I drooling?

00:03:39.011 --> 00:03:39.887
Sorry.

00:03:40.637 --> 00:03:42.848
How'd it go? Did you
make it down there in time?

00:03:43.473 --> 00:03:44.308
Yeah.

00:03:47.144 --> 00:03:48.187
You stayed.

00:03:49.354 --> 00:03:52.191
Yeah, I just wanted
to make sure…

00:03:52.983 --> 00:03:54.276
you were okay.

00:04:13.962 --> 00:04:15.047
Are you happy here?

00:04:23.013 --> 00:04:23.847
Yes.

00:04:29.853 --> 00:04:30.687
Good.

00:04:32.356 --> 00:04:33.273
Wille!

00:04:33.857 --> 00:04:35.192
Fuck! Get down.

00:04:35.776 --> 00:04:37.611
-Wille!
-I don't wanna talk to him.

00:04:39.446 --> 00:04:41.365
-Down! You're glowing.
-Wille!

00:04:43.534 --> 00:04:44.368
Wille!

00:04:45.035 --> 00:04:47.538
He's probably making out
with someone.

00:04:48.288 --> 00:04:50.832
Making out?
Did he leave with someone?

00:04:51.917 --> 00:04:53.460
Did he leave with Felice?

00:04:53.544 --> 00:04:55.254
-Quiet.
-But we were a group.

00:04:55.337 --> 00:04:57.381
Wille!

00:04:57.464 --> 00:04:59.716
-Wille.
-Don't do that.

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:01.218
-Wille!
-Wille!

00:05:03.387 --> 00:05:04.680
I said, be quiet!

00:05:29.913 --> 00:05:31.290
Wait. Wait, no, no!

00:05:33.584 --> 00:05:36.712
I cannot just be another
one of your conquests.

00:05:38.297 --> 00:05:39.798
Is that what
you think of me?

00:05:42.718 --> 00:05:44.469
It's what everyone
thinks of you.

00:06:01.612 --> 00:06:02.654
You wanna know the truth?

00:06:06.742 --> 00:06:09.411
You are the only girl
who doesn't fall at my feet…

00:06:10.454 --> 00:06:12.873
and it is driving me crazy.

00:06:14.708 --> 00:06:16.293
It's one of the things…

00:06:17.044 --> 00:06:18.462
I like about you.

00:06:18.545 --> 00:06:19.505
You're sweet…

00:06:20.464 --> 00:06:22.966
but you're not afraid
to call me out on things.

00:06:26.595 --> 00:06:28.055
And here I was
thinking I was just

00:06:28.138 --> 00:06:30.057
your brother's
annoying best friend.

00:06:31.141 --> 00:06:32.809
Well, yeah.
There's that too.

00:08:08.197 --> 00:08:10.115
I bet you really miss
your mum, huh?

00:08:12.868 --> 00:08:15.078
Yeah, every day.

00:08:17.331 --> 00:08:18.373
But, you know, it's…

00:08:19.875 --> 00:08:22.252
it's been so long now
that, like…

00:08:22.336 --> 00:08:23.670
Okay, it's like this.

00:08:23.754 --> 00:08:25.047
I'll be doing my homework

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:28.675
or I will be washing dishes
or something,

00:08:28.759 --> 00:08:31.553
and I'm thinking
about my family,

00:08:31.637 --> 00:08:34.014
and I forget
that there was a time

00:08:34.097 --> 00:08:36.099
where it wasn't just
my dad and my sisters.

00:08:37.559 --> 00:08:40.395
And it… it only happens for,
like, a quarter of a second,

00:08:40.479 --> 00:08:43.815
but… I feel really,
really guilty about it.

00:08:47.277 --> 00:08:48.779
I've never told anyone
that before.

00:08:50.739 --> 00:08:51.615
I mean, I get it.

00:08:52.491 --> 00:08:53.534
Makes sense to me.

00:08:55.494 --> 00:08:56.787
I don't actually
hate my dad,

00:08:56.870 --> 00:08:58.038
I didn't mean it like that.

00:08:59.915 --> 00:09:00.958
At least he's not, you know…

00:09:04.086 --> 00:09:04.920
Dead.

00:09:06.964 --> 00:09:07.840
Sorry.

00:09:09.550 --> 00:09:10.467
That's okay.

00:09:13.554 --> 00:09:15.305
It's actually really nice
having someone

00:09:15.389 --> 00:09:17.015
to talk to about this stuff.

00:09:18.559 --> 00:09:19.560
You're a good listener.

00:09:20.435 --> 00:09:21.436
Yeah?

00:09:22.521 --> 00:09:23.480
Why, thank you.

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:26.358
You are too.

00:09:28.026 --> 00:09:28.944
Thanks.

00:09:29.903 --> 00:09:30.863
You're welcome.

00:09:31.697 --> 00:09:33.073
That… that was amazing.

00:09:34.116 --> 00:09:34.992
That was nothing.

00:09:35.075 --> 00:09:36.910
No, it was above and beyond.

00:09:37.411 --> 00:09:38.745
You made me look great
out here.

00:09:38.829 --> 00:09:40.831
Well, it's not
a hard thing to do.

00:09:41.832 --> 00:09:42.875
Shall we go?

00:09:43.458 --> 00:09:45.419
Oh! Thank you for the meal.

00:09:45.502 --> 00:09:47.796
-It was &lt;i&gt;incroyable.&lt;/i&gt;
-You're welcome.

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:49.631
And may I just say,
you have an exquisite taste

00:09:49.715 --> 00:09:51.508
-in lingerie.
-I have what?

00:09:51.592 --> 00:09:53.510
-You do.
-He really does. Yeah.

00:09:53.594 --> 00:09:55.262
-&lt;i&gt;Bonsoir. Au revoir!&lt;/i&gt;
-Thank you again.

00:09:55.345 --> 00:09:56.972
No, I'll see you la…
I'll see you later.

00:10:01.185 --> 00:10:02.144
Emily…

00:10:04.062 --> 00:10:06.815
I have to say that
you did a good job today.

00:10:07.941 --> 00:10:11.111
Look, Silvie, I want us
to win, together,

00:10:11.195 --> 00:10:13.197
and maybe some things
get lost in translation,

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:16.116
but just… just know
that I'm finding my way.

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:17.201
We're going for drinks.

00:10:17.284 --> 00:10:18.911
You can join us
if you want, but…

00:10:18.994 --> 00:10:21.079
I think you have
better things to do.

00:10:21.997 --> 00:10:23.123
He lives downstairs.

00:10:23.207 --> 00:10:24.833
I don't wanna make it
complicated.

00:10:25.334 --> 00:10:26.960
Oh, sometimes
the best relationships

00:10:27.044 --> 00:10:28.086
are complicated.

00:10:44.228 --> 00:10:45.395
Did you forget something?

00:10:46.063 --> 00:10:46.939
I did.

00:11:00.327 --> 00:11:01.328
Good night.

